{
 "encounter_id": "00623",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "FAMILY_MEMBER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hello. Um. I don't really know why we're here, it was Mark's idea. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'm her husband, doctor. I made the appointment. I hope that's all right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Of course it is. Thanks for coming, both of you. Let's start with you, Sarah, what's been going on? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm just... tired. I'm a nurse on the acute medical ward, so everyone's tired, it's the job."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You're not wrong, but you came in, so I'd like to hear about your tired. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's a different sort of tired. I wake up and I'm exhausted before I've done anything. I feel exhausted all the time."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long has it been like that?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Since the winter, probably. I don't know, I stopped counting."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Are you having any trouble sleeping at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I'm sleeping fine, actually. Seven hours, more or less."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She's up at three most nights, love. I hear her in the kitchen."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's, I just get a glass of water, Mark. That's not being awake."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks for telling me, both of you. I'll note what you each said. Have you had any thoughts of harming yourself?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Never. I'd tell you, I'm not that kind of tired."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I appreciate that. Let's look at the medicines. What are you taking at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sertraline, 100 mg once a day. Zopiclone, 3.75 mg at night, only when I need it. Omeprazole, 20 mg in the morning, and propranolol, 40 mg for the shakes when I have a bad shift."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And the sertraline, you're taking that daily?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Every day. I never miss it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "She does miss it, love. I find the strip half full on Sundays."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That was once, Mark."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm not going to decide who's right here. I'll just record that you both told me different things. Any allergies to anything?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Latex. I get a rash on my hands from the gloves."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good to know. And your health background?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Depression, diagnosed a few years ago. Migraine, and acid reflux, which is what the omeprazole is for."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And alcohol, do you drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I have a drink most evenings. A glass of wine, usually. It helps me switch off."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Mostly a glass. Sometimes two. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks. Let me check you over. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll wait right here. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 78, blood pressure 118 over 74, temperature 36.7, oxygen 99 percent. Your pulse is regular.",
   "pause": 14.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is everything all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your numbers are fine. Sarah, this isn't weakness, it's what burnout looks like. You've been running on empty. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm scared if I stop, I'll fall apart. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What I'd like is a fit note for two weeks, to start with. We'll talk about your hours with occupational health as well."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I can't just leave my team short. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Sarah, please. You're not the only nurse in the hospital. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Take the two weeks, and let's see how you feel at the end. I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. Okay. Okay, I'll try. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And Mark, thank you for bringing her. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
